msgid "Wait for an answer (seconds)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "How long one try waits for an answer before it counts as lost. If left empty, 4 seconds are used."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/fields.js
msgid "Time between two rounds of checks while the link is healthy. Low values notice problems sooner but may mark a shaky link down too eagerly. If left empty, 10 seconds are used."
msgstr ""

