msgstr "首次检测前的状态"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid "What MultiWAN 4 assumes until the first health check finishes. Online uses the link at once; Offline keeps it out of use until a check passes. Online by default."
msgstr "在首次健康检查完成前，MultiWAN 4 对此接口状态的预设。选择“在线”会立即使用该接口；选择“离线”则在检测通过前不使用。默认在线。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/interfaces.js
msgid "IPv4, IPv6 or both: the kinds of traffic this WAN link carries. Choose only what the link really connects. If left empty, IPv4 is used."
msgstr "此 WAN 接口承载的流量类型：IPv4、IPv6 或两者。请仅选择此接口实际连接的协议类型。留空时使用 IPv4。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid "The WAN link this entry belongs to. A link needs an entry here before a path can use it. Required."
msgstr "此条目所属的 WAN 接口。路径使用某个接口前，必须先在此处为其添加条目。必填。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid "Priority (lower is used first)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid "Links with a lower number are used first; links with the same number share the traffic by weight. 1 by default."
msgstr "优先使用数值较小的接口；优先级相同的接口按权重分担流量。默认值为 1。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/routes.js
msgid "Share of new connections this link gets among links with the same priority: weight 3 gets three times as many as weight 1. 1 by default."
msgstr "在优先级相同的接口之间，此接口分配到的新连接比例。权重为 3 的接口获得的连接数约为权重为 1 的三倍。默认值为 1。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Turn off to keep the rule but stop using it. On by default."
msgstr "关闭后保留此规则，但不再使用。默认开启。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "The name shown on the overview. If left empty, the internal name of the rule is shown."
msgstr "概览页面中显示的名称。留空时显示规则的内部名称。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Set by MultiWAN 4 to count the connections of this rule; it never changes while the rule exists. Do not edit."
msgstr "由 MultiWAN 4 自动设置，用于统计此规则的连接数；规则存在期间不会更改。请勿编辑。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "IPv4, IPv6 or both. A rule is checked separately for each, so add both only for a rule meant for both. New rules start as IPv4; if left empty, the rule applies to both."
msgstr "IPv4、IPv6 或两者。规则会分别针对每种协议检查，因此仅在规则同时适用于两者时才选择两者。新规则默认使用 IPv4；留空时规则同时适用于两者。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Which kind of traffic matches. Choose TCP or UDP to match ports. All protocols by default."
msgstr "要匹配的流量协议类型。若要匹配端口，请选择 TCP 或 UDP。默认匹配所有协议。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Source addresses"
msgstr "源地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic from these addresses or networks (CIDR) matches. If left empty, traffic from any address matches."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Source devices (MAC addresses)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic from these devices matches. If left empty, any device matches."
msgstr "仅匹配来自这些设备的流量。留空时匹配任意设备。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Incoming network"
msgstr "入站网络"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic that enters the router from this network matches. If left empty, traffic from any network matches."
msgstr "仅匹配从此网络进入路由器的流量。留空时匹配来自任意网络的流量。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Any network"
msgstr "任意网络"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic from these source ports matches: single ports, ranges or comma-separated lists. Needs TCP or UDP. If left empty, any source port matches."
msgstr "仅匹配来自指定源端口的流量：可填写单个端口、端口范围或逗号分隔的列表。需要选择 TCP 或 UDP。留空时匹配任意源端口。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Destination addresses"
msgstr "目标地址"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic going to these addresses or networks matches. If left empty, any destination matches. Use 0.0.0.0/0 or ::/0 only for a catch-all rule."
msgstr "仅匹配发往这些地址或网络的流量。留空时匹配任意目标地址。仅在创建全匹配规则时使用 0.0.0.0/0 或 ::/0。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Traffic to these domains and their subdomains matches. The router learns their addresses from DNS, which needs dnsmasq-full. If left empty, domains are not used."
msgstr "匹配发往这些域名及其子域名的流量。路由器通过 DNS 获取域名对应的地址，此功能需要 dnsmasq-full。留空时不按域名匹配。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic going to these ports matches: single ports, ranges or comma-separated lists. Needs TCP or UDP. If left empty, any port matches."
msgstr "仅匹配发往指定目标端口的流量：可填写单个端口、端口范围或逗号分隔的列表。需要选择 TCP 或 UDP。留空时匹配任意端口。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Only traffic tagged with this DSCP priority (1-63) matches, such as calls or games. If left empty, the tag is ignored."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Name of an nft set whose addresses match. Most rules do not need it; destination domains are easier. If left empty, no set is used."
msgstr "符合匹配条件的 nft 集合名称。大多数规则无需设置此项，使用目标域名更简单。留空时不使用集合。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Where matching traffic goes: one of your paths, normal routing, or blocked. Required."
msgstr "匹配到的流量应如何处理：使用指定路径、正常路由或阻止流量。必填。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Path: %s"
msgstr "路径：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Normal routing (main table)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Block the traffic (rejected)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Block the traffic (dropped silently)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Sticky sessions (keep a device on one link)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Keep the new connections of a device on the link it used before, for the time below. Off by default."
msgstr "在下方指定的时间内，让设备的新连接继续使用之前的接口。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Keep a device on its link for (seconds)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "How long a device stays on its link after its last matching connection. 600 seconds by default."
msgstr "设备在最后一次匹配连接后，继续保持使用该接口的时长。默认 600 秒。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Also apply the rule to traffic the router itself sends, such as its own updates. Off by default, so only forwarded traffic matches."
msgstr "此规则也应用于路由器自身发出的流量（例如系统更新）。默认关闭，因此仅匹配转发流量。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/rules.js
msgid "Write a log line for each match. Needs Log matching rules in Global settings. Off by default."
msgstr "每次匹配时写入一条日志。需要在“全局设置”中启用“记录匹配规则”。默认关闭。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "The links this path may use, taken from the Link priorities tab. The lowest healthy priority wins; equal priorities share the traffic by weight. At least one is required."
msgstr "此路径可使用的接口，来自“接口优先级”选项卡。优先使用健康状态下优先级数值最低的接口；优先级相同时按权重分担流量。至少需要一个接口。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "When no link in the path is available"
msgstr "路径中没有可用接口时"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "What happens to the traffic of this path when every link in it is down or on hold. Stopping the traffic keeps it from leaking to another link; normal routing lets it follow the router default route. Stop the traffic (rejected) by default."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Stop the traffic (rejected)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Stop the traffic (dropped silently)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/strategies.js
msgid "Use normal routing"
msgstr "使用正常路由"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Path override"
msgstr "路径覆盖"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Path of the matched rule"
msgstr "匹配规则使用的路径"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Counters are grouped by routing rules, paths, WAN links, PBR, tunnels, and other runtime owners so rule matches are easier to audit."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No mwan4 counters reported. Generate traffic that should match a routing rule, then run Counters again."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Show the tuple, matched rule, selected WAN link, firewall mark, route table, and fallback behavior for a routing decision."
msgstr "显示路由决策所依据的流量参数、匹配规则、选定的 WAN 接口、防火墙标记、路由表及回退行为。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Matched rule"
msgstr "匹配的规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No rule matched"
msgstr "没有匹配的规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "The first routing rule that accepted the tuple"
msgstr "第一个匹配此流量参数的路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Skipped rules and trace"
msgstr "已跳过的规则及跟踪信息"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No skipped-rule trace was reported."
msgstr "没有报告已跳过规则的跟踪信息。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Relative order of routing rule lookups"
msgstr "路由规则的匹配顺序"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Show tunnel metadata, endpoint underlay routes, recursion risk, path, and data-plane reachability."
msgstr "显示隧道元数据、端点底层路由、递归风险、路径及数据平面连通性。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Links enabled for routing rules"
msgstr "已启用路由规则的接口"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Show route lines copied or inspected by mwan4 before routes are generated."
msgstr "显示 mwan4 在生成路由前复制或检查的路由条目。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Routing rule lookups"
msgstr "路由规则匹配"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Routing rules for IPv4"
msgstr "IPv4 路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Routing rules for IPv6"
msgstr "IPv6 路由规则"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "No routing rule lines were reported."
msgstr "没有报告路由规则条目。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Verify generated mwan4 nftables chains and installed rule files before debugging rule matches."
msgstr "在排查规则匹配问题前，验证 mwan4 生成的 nftables 链和已安装的规则文件。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Inspect latency and loss decisions, then explain the route choice for a representative traffic tuple."
msgstr "检查延迟和丢包判定，并分析一组典型流量参数对应的路由选择。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Review tunnel metadata, endpoint routes, recursion risk, tunnel endpoint path, and data-plane reachability."
msgstr "检查隧道元数据、端点路由、递归风险、隧道端点路径及数据平面连通性。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/diagnostics.js
msgid "Group rule, path, WAN link, PBR, and tunnel counters so hit counts line up with the routing decision."
msgstr "按规则、路径、WAN 接口、PBR 和隧道分组统计计数器，使命中次数与路由决策对应。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Values written to the kernel when the service reloads. If a limit is left empty, the kernel default is kept."
msgstr "服务重新加载时写入内核的值。限制项留空时保留内核默认值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Turn on MPTCP in the kernel (net.mptcp.enabled) when the configuration is applied. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Accepted extra addresses (ADD_ADDR limit)"
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "How many extra addresses announced by the other side the kernel accepts. If left empty, the kernel default is kept."
msgstr "内核允许接收对端通告的额外地址数量。留空时保留内核默认值。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "How many extra connections (subflows) the kernel may open for one MPTCP connection. If left empty, the kernel default is kept."
msgstr ""

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Declare only endpoints that MultiWAN 4 owns. Each needs an ID so MultiWAN 4 can remove what it created without touching other MPTCP settings."
msgstr "这里只声明由 MultiWAN 4 管理的端点。每个端点都需要一个 ID，以便 MultiWAN 4 删除自身创建的配置，而不影响其他 MPTCP 设置。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Turn off to keep the endpoint configured but not applied. On by default."
msgstr "关闭后保留端点配置，但不应用该端点。默认开启。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "The WAN link whose address and device own this endpoint. Required."
msgstr "此端点使用其地址和设备的 WAN 接口。必填。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Which address version to use when the endpoint address is taken from the WAN link. If left empty, it follows the WAN link."
msgstr "当端点地址取自 WAN 接口时，指定使用的 IP 协议版本。留空时跟随 WAN 接口。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Address announced for this endpoint. If left empty, the current address of the selected WAN link is used."
msgstr "此端点向对端通告的地址。留空时使用所选 WAN 接口的当前地址。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "A fixed endpoint number that lets MultiWAN 4 recognise and remove its own endpoint. Required."
msgstr "固定的端点编号，用于让 MultiWAN 4 识别并删除自身创建的端点。必填。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "What the kernel may do with this endpoint: announce it to the other side, open extra connections from it, keep it as backup, or pair it with every address of the other side. Choose at least one. Required."
msgstr "指定内核如何使用此端点：向对端通告、从此端点建立额外连接、将其设为备用端点，或与对端的每个地址配对。至少选择一项。必填。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "chosen by the kernel"
msgstr "由内核选择"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/mptcp.js
msgid "Port announced for this endpoint. If left empty, the kernel chooses it; most endpoints should leave it empty."
msgstr "此端点向对端通告的端口。留空时由内核选择；大多数端点应保持为空。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/advanced.js
msgid "Keep mwan4 table IDs and marks explicit before combining VRFs, source routing, and generated routing rules."
msgstr "在组合使用 VRF、源地址路由和自动生成的路由规则前，请明确指定 mwan4 的路由表 ID 和标记。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/network/overview.js
msgid "Counted as online to offline transitions in the recent window, and in all recorded history."
msgstr "统计最近时间窗口及全部历史记录中的在线转离线次数。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Try restarting MultiWAN 4. If this message stays, run Full diagnostics below."
msgstr "请尝试重启 MultiWAN 4。如果此消息仍然存在，请运行下方的“完整诊断”。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Try restarting MultiWAN 4. If this message stays, open Diagnostics."
msgstr "请尝试重启 MultiWAN 4。如果此消息仍然存在，请打开“诊断”页面。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Try restarting MultiWAN 4. If this message stays, ask an administrator who can open Diagnostics."
msgstr "请尝试重启 MultiWAN 4。如果此消息仍然存在，请联系有权限打开“诊断”页面的管理员。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Run Full diagnostics to see the other warnings."
msgstr "运行“完整诊断”以查看其他警告。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Open Diagnostics to see the other warnings."
msgstr "打开“诊断”页面以查看其他警告。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "Ask an administrator who can open Diagnostics for the other warnings."
msgstr "请联系有权限打开“诊断”页面的管理员查看其他警告。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "What to do: %s"
msgstr "建议操作：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "How to check: %s"
msgstr "检查方法：%s"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 needs attention"
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 需要处理"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/mwan4/common.js
msgid "MultiWAN 4 is set up but is not fully running, so failover and routing rules may not be applied."
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 已完成配置，但未完全运行，因此故障切换和路由规则可能尚未生效。"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "Open the overview"
msgstr "打开概览"

#: luci-app-mwan4/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/mwan4/status/overview.js
msgid "A read-only summary of MultiWAN 4. The buttons below appear only if this account may open those pages."
msgstr "MultiWAN 4 的只读状态摘要。仅当当前账户有权限访问相应页面时，才会显示下方按钮。"

